- content_for :title do
  | Reversement #{@agreement.lodging&.name} — #{@statement.period_label}

.mb-6.flex.items-start.justify-between
  div
    h1.text-2xl.font-semibold.text-gray-900
      | Reversement — #{@statement.period_label}
    p.text-sm.text-gray-500
      = @agreement.lodging&.name
      span.mx-1 ·
      = "#{l(@statement.period_from, format: :long).squish} → #{l(@statement.period_to, format: :long).squish}"
  button.text-sm.text-gray-500.underline(class="print:hidden" type="button" onclick="window.print()")
    | Imprimer

.mb-6.p-4.rounded-lg.bg-gray-50
  table.w-full.text-sm
    tbody
      tr
        td.py-1.text-gray-600 Recettes de la période
        td.py-1.text-right= number_to_currency(@statement.base_cents / 100.0)
      tr.border-t.border-gray-300
        td.py-2.font-semibold.text-gray-900= "Votre part (#{@agreement.share_percent} %)"
        td.py-2.text-right.text-xl.font-semibold.text-gray-900= number_to_currency(@statement.share_cents / 100.0)

- if @lines.any?
  h2.text-sm.uppercase.tracking-wide.text-gray-400.mb-2 Le détail
  table.w-full.text-sm.mb-6
    tbody
      - @lines.each do |line|
        tr.border-b.border-gray-100
          td.py-1.5.text-gray-500.whitespace-nowrap
            - if line.from_date
              = "#{l(line.from_date, format: :short)} → #{l(line.to_date, format: :short)}"
          td.py-1.5.text-gray-800= line.label
          td.py-1.5.text-right.whitespace-nowrap.text-gray-900= number_to_currency(line.amount_cents / 100.0)

.p-4.rounded-lg.bg-teal-50.text-sm.text-teal-900
  p
    | Le virement partira avec
    strong = " #{@statement.reference}"
    |  en communication.
    - if @agreement.iban_masked
      = " Compte : #{@agreement.iban_masked}."
  p.mt-2.text-teal-800
    | Une ligne vous semble fausse ? Signalez-la — ce relevé est figé, la correction apparaîtra sur le suivant.

p.mt-8.text-xs.text-gray-400
  | Les 4 Sources · relevé émis le #{l(@statement.issued_at.to_date, format: :long).squish if @statement.issued_at}
